    "text": "IT is hereby notified that His Excellency the President in the exercise of powers vested in him, under Article 47(a) of theConstitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, has removed Hon. Prime Minister, Dissanayake MudiyanselageJayaratne, from the office of the Prime Minister, with effect from January 09, 2015.",
